Lesson (stxt.play.tutorial): Comments
    Number of lesson: 3/5
    Introduction >>
        Comments are lines that start with #
        # This line is NOT a comment!!
        Remember: **Inside a bloc of text, all is text**
    # This is a external comment, so ends the block 'Introduction'
# This is a comment too

# ------------------
# Rules for comments
# ------------------
#  - The line must start whith #
#  - Must be indented like nodes
#  - No comments inside blocks
#  - A external comment finishes a block of text